      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "ArisGlobal, a provider of life sciences technology spanning pharmacovigilance, regulatory, medical affairs, clinical, and quality functions, developed NavaX, an AI engine purpose-built for life sciences on Amazon Bedrock , to automate adverse-event case processing.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-arisglobal-scaled-generative-ai-inference-on-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T15:57:09.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T19:08:55.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "ArisGlobal chose Amazon Bedrock for managed access to foundation models, EU geographic cross-Region inference, and managed prompt caching.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-arisglobal-scaled-generative-ai-inference-on-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T15:57:09.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T19:08:55.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As enterprise customers added distinct compliance requirements, the shared prompt prefix grew by about 150% over 6 months, while per-case inference costs increased by more than 200%.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-arisglobal-scaled-generative-ai-inference-on-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T15:57:09.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T19:08:55.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "LifeSphere serves pharmaceutical companies globally, including multiple Top 20 pharma organizations by revenue (source: ArisGlobal press release ).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-arisglobal-scaled-generative-ai-inference-on-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T15:57:09.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T19:08:55.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "ArisGlobal productionized their first generative AI solution on Amazon Bedrock with Anthropic’s Claude in March 2025.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-arisglobal-scaled-generative-ai-inference-on-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T15:57:09.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T19:08:55.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "According to ArisGlobal’s internal production telemetry, they have processed over 1 million real transactions in regulated pharmaceutical environments, handling billions of tokens across multiple enterprise tenants.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-arisglobal-scaled-generative-ai-inference-on-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T15:57:09.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T19:08:55.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With multiple sequential requests per case, per-case inference costs increased by more than 200%.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-arisglobal-scaled-generative-ai-inference-on-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T15:57:09.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T19:08:55.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For Claude Sonnet 4.5 the minimum is 1,024 tokens (see supported models and Regions ).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-arisglobal-scaled-generative-ai-inference-on-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T15:57:09.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T19:08:55.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Bedrock searches backward from that point for the longest matching prefix, up to about 20 content blocks.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-arisglobal-scaled-generative-ai-inference-on-amazon-bedrock/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-17T15:57:09.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T19:08:55.808Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To learn more, see the Amazon Bedrock prompt caching documentation , the cross-Region inference guide , and the AWS blog post Effectively use prompt caching on Amazon Bedrock .",
